      `s 492.3: the court must take into account a frivolous or dilatory action or an action not made in good faith` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `an application was made under subsection 38.04(1) or (2) of that Act in respect of a notice arising from the prosecution of the offence given under any of subsections 38.01(1) to (4) of that Act` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day the application was made` IS A DATE
